<section class="feature-grid"><a class="feature-card" href="contracts"><div class="feature-icon icon-sage">▤</div><h3>Understand your contract</h3><p>Contract scanning is in development. The current preview does not upload or retain files; secure document review is a planned feature.</p><span class="feature-link">Explore contract tools ↗</span></a><a class="feature-card" href="leave"><div class="feature-icon icon-lilac">◷</div><h3>Leave without the maths</h3><p>Submit requests and review decisions. Ledger balances appear only after an employer configures and activates a reviewed policy.</p><span class="feature-link">Explore leave tracking ↗</span></a><a class="feature-card" href="benefits"><div class="feature-icon icon-gold">✳</div><h3>Keep benefits in view</h3><p>Benefit reminders and salary estimates are planned. Current benefit figures are examples, not payroll results.</p><span class="feature-link">Explore benefits ↗</span></a><a class="feature-card" href="team"><div class="feature-icon icon-blue">⌂</div><h3>Give teams clarity</h3><p>Create a company workspace and employment records. Staff invitations and advanced role management are still in development.</p><span class="feature-link">Explore team tools ↗</span></a></section>
